<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Rohm &amp; Haas raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Rohm &amp; Haas raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it upgraded Rohm &amp; Haas Co to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose one to 80.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
